Mythic\"\n    }\n}\n\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0vma/Strelizia/refs/heads/main/Loader.lua\"))()","features":"This is the best bubble gum simulator infnity script  right now, it's got a key system but it's easy to use and totally worth it, doesn't have many features right now but we will add them as the time goes. \n\nHUGE Feature list on our discord too\n\n##\\\\ Latest Changelogs \\\\##\n\n##\\\\ v0.0.4.4 \\\\##\n// FARMING\n[/] Auto Farm Currency will no longer fail to teleport hopefully\n\n// PETS\n[/] Fixed some eggs not being displayed in the hatch dropdown\n\n// MINIGAMES\n[+] Added Target Item selection for robot claw\n\n##\\\\ v0.0.4.1 \\\\##\n// SERVER HOPPER\n[+] Added AutoExecute flag to RiftHopperRejoinData which will automatically re-execute the script once it rejoins so you don't need to have it in ur auto exec (optional)\n[/] Server hop now holds onto a cached server list for maximum 30 seconds which was infinite before causing it to attempt joining dead servers\n[/] Minimum serverhopper luck field is now a dictionary like the rift one\n[/] Removed useless fields from the server cache to minimize file size\n[/] Removed re-search delay after failed tp, should be way faster now\n[/] High Ping / Low FPS Servers will be ignored\n[/] Visited servers will now have their fields automatically cleaned up after a certain amount of time to minimize file size\n[/] Added more error handling for failed curls which permanently broke the hopper\n\n// FARMING\n[+] Added Currency Dropdown to auto farm currency\n[/] Improved Auto Sell\n[/] Auto Sell now teleports back to saved position instead of orig pos\n\n// HATCHING\n[/] Removed auto hatching sync delay which slowed down egg hatching in some cases, sacrificed quota\n\n// PETS\n[+] Added Tokens to auto equip\n[/] Further more decreased auto delete max size to prevent unexpected kicks\n[/] Lookup pets now automatically updates for new currencies\n[/] All pet stats will now have their decimals clamped to prevent unexpected float lenghts\n[/] Increased minimum public hatch chance to 1 / 25m or secret rarity\n\n// MINIGAMES\n[+] Added Dice Board (Target Items, Golden Dice if below x nodes away from target) (uses smart dice algo)\n[+] Added Auto Farm Special Egg\n[+] Added Disable Minigame Animation\n[+] Added EVERY Minigame (auto updating for most of the new ones to come)\n[+] Added Auto Super Ticket Minigames\n\n// TELEPORTS\n[+] Added Auto Purchase Worlds\n[+] Added Auto Unlock Islands (Toggle)\n\n\n// OTHERS\n[+] Added way more game loaded checks for auto exec\n[/] Fixed all public webhooks (sorry for long downtimes lol)\n[/] Teleporting is FAR more efficient now teleporting you to the expected world before lerping which greatly increases speed (works only if the world is unlocked)\n[/] Auto Add Friends is far more efficient now\n\n##\\\\ v0.0.4.0 \\\\##\n// Pets\n[+] Added Toggle to Switch to \"Only Pets\" for auto shiny\n\n// Other\n[+] Added Unlock Hatch Zone\n[+] Added Friend All\n[/] Some Webhook stuff\n\njoin our discord if you have suggestions/questions and leave a comment if you liked the script! \nhttps://discord.gg/Vf4Wu3Cft7","tags":["Strelizia","Script","Op","Cheat","Best"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/Vf4Wu3Cft7","keyLink":"https://discord.gg/Vf4Wu3Cft7","owner":{"_id":"61b4ff6e66c4ed24724702da","username":"Pryxo","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/539e1a0ae7ada9c28294c330d6cf0ee14c9aca988ce072ae42efb64173e948ba.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61b4ff6e66c4ed24724702da-1768094397311.png"},"status":"offline","id":"61b4ff6e66c4ed24724702da","leaderboard":{"tag":null},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.views","tier":1000000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/539e1a0ae7ada9c28294c330d6cf0ee14c9aca988ce072ae42efb64173e948ba.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61b4ff6e66c4ed24724702da-1768094397311.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"ve